# Unreal Engine build/derived output. Everything the repo tracks under
# unreal/ is text: .uproject, Config/*.ini, Source/**, Content/Data/*.json.
Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
*.sln
# UE 5.8 writes the newer XML solution format alongside the classic .sln,
# including an Automation_*.slnx.
*.slnx
*.suo
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.filters
*.vcxproj.user
.vs/
.vsconfig
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/
